{%- comment -%}
  The clinics and doctors the booking flow shows, straight from Shopify, with
  no request to the CMS, rendered into the page as JSON for kal-booking-flow.js
  to read (getShopifyCatalog()).

  Clinics: shop.metaobjects.clinic (Clinic entries): facility_id (the CMS
  clinic id), name, address, city, timings.

  Doctors: every product picked in Theme settings > "Doctor consultation
  products" (settings.kal_doctor_products) that has custom.doctor_id set is a
  doctor. The profile is in the product's own metafields (all in the
  "custom" namespace): doctor_id (the CMS staff id), name, photo, qualification,
  specialization (list), experience, languages (list), bio, and clinics (list of
  Clinic entries: where the doctor is offered). A doctor with no doctor_id is
  skipped; any other empty field just shows nothing. The old Doctor entries are
  not read any more (the metaobject itself is left in Shopify for now).

  Prices come from that same product's variants. Each variant is one clinic and
  one mode: option "Mode" is "In-Clinic" or "Online", the metafield
  custom.facility_id is the clinic id, the variant price is the fee, and the
  optional custom.pay_now_discount_percent is the In-Clinic pay-now discount.
  variant.price is in the smallest currency unit (paise for INR).

  variant.price is the price Shopify shows shoppers, so it equals the price
  saved on the variant only while Shopify adds nothing to it. Tax charged on
  the variant makes Shopify show the price with tax added (a 9% tax showed
  ₹545 for a ₹500 variant), so "Charge tax" must stay off on these variants.

  Liquid can only read a product that is published to the Online Store
  channel, so a doctor product that is unpublished does not appear.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/json" id="kal-shopify-catalog">
{
  "currency": {{ shop.currency | json }},
  "clinics": [
    {%- for clinic in shop.metaobjects.clinic.values -%}
    {
      "id": {{ clinic.facility_id.value | json }},
      "name": {{ clinic.name.value | json }},
      "address": {{ clinic.address.value | json }},
      "city": {{ clinic.city.value | json }},
      "timings": {{ clinic.timings.value | json }}
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ],
  "doctors": [
    {%- assign wrote_doctor = false -%}
    {%- for product in settings.kal_doctor_products -%}
    {%- assign doctor_id = product.metafields.custom.doctor_id.value -%}
    {%- if doctor_id != blank -%}
    {%- if wrote_doctor %},{% endif -%}
    {%- assign wrote_doctor = true -%}
    {%- assign specialization = product.metafields.custom.specialization.value -%}
    {%- assign languages = product.metafields.custom.languages.value -%}
    {
      "id": {{ doctor_id | json }},
      "name": {{ product.metafields.custom.name.value | json }},
      "qualification": {{ product.metafields.custom.qualification.value | json }},
      "specialization": {% if specialization != blank %}{{ specialization | json }}{% else %}[]{% endif %},
      "experience": {{ product.metafields.custom.experience.value | json }},
      "languages": {% if languages != blank %}{{ languages | json }}{% else %}[]{% endif %},
      "bio": {{ product.metafields.custom.bio.value | json }},
      {%- if product.metafields.custom.photo.value != blank %}
      "photoUrl": {{ product.metafields.custom.photo.value | image_url: width: 400 | json }},
      {%- else %}
      "photoUrl": null,
      {%- endif %}
      "clinicIds": [
        {%- for clinic in product.metafields.custom.clinics.value -%}
        {{ clinic.facility_id.value | json }}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
        {%- endfor -%}
      ],
      "pricing": [
        {%- render 'kal-shopify-catalog-pricing', consultation_product: product -%}
      ]
    }
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
</script>
